    "create_time": 1763436924.225,
    "update_time": null,
    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Split it rather than delete it. Keep \"stuck\" for stuck with no error on screen (staring at a blank function, rereading the spec), and add \"stalled-after-error\" for the error case. Then remap old labels:\n\n- old \"stuck\" + error visible in window → `stalled_after_error`\n- old \"stuck\" + no error → `stuck`\n\nYou can do that remap automatically from telemetry (you know when an error was displayed), then spot-check ~30."
     ]
    },
